        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "**EMAIL ENQUIRIES ONLY / NO PHONE CALLS**\r\n\r\nDoran Estates are delighted to present 46 Melvin Road to the rental market, a well-located three-bedroom home situated in a quiet residential enclave, just a short stroll from the heart of Terenure Village.\r\n\r\nThe property is available unfurnished, with the option to furnish it if required.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a bright and spacious living room, a fully equipped kitchen/dining area, three well-proportioned bedrooms and two bathrooms, one of which benefits from a bath. The property also benefits from off-street parking and a south-west facing rear garden, which enjoys sunshine well into the late evening.\r\nThe location is one of the key features of this property. Terenure Village is within easy walking distance and offers a wide selection of cafés, restaurants, shops, supermarkets and everyday amenities. The area is well served by regular bus routes providing convenient access to Dublin city centre, while the M50 is also within easy reach.\r\nThere is a good choice of well-regarded schools in the surrounding area, including Terenure College, Our Lady’s School, Presentation Terenure, The High School Rathgar, Harold’s Cross National School and Harold’s Cross Educate Together.\r\nFor those who enjoy outdoor activities, Bushy Park is close by and provides extensive green space, walking routes, tennis courts and playing facilities. A variety of rugby, tennis, golf, football and GAA clubs can also be found in the surrounding area.\r\n46 Melvin Road offers well-proportioned accommodation in a highly convenient South Dublin location, with Terenure Village and a wide range of local amenities right on its doorstep.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended."
      },
